Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Application Not Deploying to Managed Clusters
Symptoms: Application shows as created but pods are not appearing on managed clusters.

Solution:

# Check cluster labels
oc get managedclusters --show-labels

# Verify placement rule matches
oc describe placementrule health-demo-placement -n health-demo

# Check if clusters meet placement criteria
oc get managedclusters -o custom-columns=NAME:.metadata.name,AVAILABLE:.status.conditions[0].status
Issue 2: Health Checks Failing
Symptoms: Pods are running but health checks are failing.

Solution:

# Check pod logs
oc logs -l app=health-demo -n health-demo

# Test health endpoint manually
oc exec -it deployment/health-demo-app -n health-demo -- curl localhost/health

# Check service configuration
oc describe service health-demo-service -n health-demo
Issue 3: Rollout Stuck in Progress
Symptoms: Rollout is not progressing through canary stages.

Solution:

# Check rollout status
oc describe rollout health-demo-rollout -n health-demo

# Check analysis results
oc get analysisrun -n health-demo

# Manual promotion if needed
oc argo rollouts promote health-demo-rollout -n health-demo
